# Daccord's Certum "Open Source Code Signing in the Cloud" certificate.
#
# PUBLIC data - this is the certificate, not the key. The private key is
# non-exportable and lives in Certum's HSM; it is reached at signing time
# through SimplySign (see dist/simplysign-login-linux.sh).
#
# It is committed because Certum's PKCS#11 module cannot be enumerated:
# pkcs11-tool --list-objects segfaults against it and p11tool lists nothing, so
# osslsigncode cannot discover the certificate on the token and has to be
# handed it. Subject: Open Source Developer Jacob Cattrall. Expires 2027-08-11
# - replace this file at renewal.
